# `tobool`: `"true"`/`"false"` in any case, numbers (0 is false).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = tobool('TRUE'), b = tobool('false'), c = tobool('yes'), d = tobool(0), e = tobool(-3), f = tobool(0.0), g = tobool(true)
---- expected
a    | b     | c    | d     | e    | f     | g
bool | bool  | bool | bool  | bool | bool  | bool
-----+-------+------+-------+------+-------+-----
true | false | null | false | true | false | true
